# Normalise to LF in the repo. The Dockerfile still strips CR from entrypoint.sh as
# a belt-and-braces guard, because a shebang with a trailing \r fails in the
# container with a "no such file or directory" that names the file that exists.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Fonts are binary; EOL normalisation would silently corrupt them.
*.woff2 binary
*.svg text eol=lf
